00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.800
Well, we're gonna find out today.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:45.920
So, let's talk about the things

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.380
that your parents told you about the law

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.950
that are probably not true.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:51.020
The first, of course,
is staying home alone

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.310
while your parents shopped.

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:54.220
Kevin McAllister was home
alone for several days,

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.460
and he totally handled it,

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.410
so why is it that our parents told us

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.130
that you couldn't stay home alone?

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.840
I know more than a few of you fantasized

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.390
about ordering a pizza and
jumping up and down on your bed

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:05.390
while your siblings were
forced to spend time

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:06.870
at some old relative's house.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:09.030
And, of course, we all plan to do this.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:11.560
- I'm gonna give you to the count of ten

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:16.430
to get your ugly, yella,
no-good keister off my property,

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:18.540
before I pump your guts full of lead!

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:19.920
- But, of course, our parents were worried

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:21.290
that we were going to this.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.160
- Johnny, I got so much energy.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:24.920
We've gotta start doing stupid (beep).

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:27.300
- So, I suppose this might
explain why after the success

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:28.890
of "Home Alone," and its numerous sequels,

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.500
why our parents didn't trust us

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.750
to outwit hapless burglars on our own.

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.810
And, of course, they
claim that it was illegal

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:35.810
to leave you at home,

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:37.810
even if they were just
running to the store.

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:39.760
But is it in fact true that the state

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:41.320
makes it illegal to leave your kids

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:43.110
