00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.190
religious holidays, family vacations,

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:15.070
medical appointments,
illnesses, suspensions,

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:17.570
family emergencies, if you're
the victim of bullying,

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.490
or for a much needed mental health break

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.670
related to because you needed to sleep in,

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.670
the weather is nice, the weather
is bad, the weather is sad,

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:25.680
it's the end of the world as
we know it, it's opening day,

