00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:45.580
And the verdict is in, and it depends.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:46.990
Jurisdictions vary a lot on whether

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:49.120
you can legally ride
in the back of a truck.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.520
In many States, it's not against the law

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.050
for anyone to roll down the street

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:53.150
in the back of a truck bed.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.970
Other States ban riding in truck beds,

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:57.340
except under very certain circumstances.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:58.930
Ohio law is pretty representative

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.420
of the states that have restrictions.

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:03.610
State law bans people 15 and
under from riding in the back,

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:06.320
