likely place to find a seat belt.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:21.860
So, if you can't wear a seat belt,

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:23.690
then you can't ride in
the back of a truck.

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:24.930
But if your parents didn't want you

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:26.030
riding the back of a truck,

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:27.730
they probably had really good reason.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.870
The National Highway
Safety Transportation Board

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.550
says that trucks are
three times more likely

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:33.140
to be involved in a rollover crash,

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:35.230
