00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:37.030
for the highest number of fatalities,

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:40.560
and if you're not seat-belted
in to the back of a truck,

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.390
your odds are not very good

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:43.780
if you get into an actual crash.

